  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『Fate/Grand Order』よりセイバークラスのサーヴァント沖田総司がぷちりっつで登場！",
      "en": "From \"Fate/Grand Order\", the Saber class servant Souji Okita is now available as a petit figure!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• シンプルなパーツ構成により初心者でも手軽に楽しめる組み立てやすさを実現。",
      "en": "• Simple parts configuration makes assembly easy even for beginners."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ディテールもしっかり再現。",
      "en": "• Details are well reproduced."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ３頭身ながらキャラクターの特徴あるシルエットラインそのままに、印象を覆すことなくかわいくデフォルメ。",
      "en": "• Although it has three heads, it maintains the character's distinctive silhouette line and is cutely deformed without overturning the impression."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 上半身の可動によりプロポーションを崩さずに表情あるポージングが可能。",
      "en": "• The upper body can be moved to create expressive poses without changing the proportions."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 愛用の武器「菊一文字則宗」と鞘が付属。",
      "en": "• Favorite weapon \"Kikuichimonji Norimune\" and scabbard are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• キャラクターをイメージした専用台座付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a special pedestal inspired by the character."
    }
  ],
